{"2733890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bloody Shrine", "steam_appid": 2733890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>The shrine demands blood. You will provide it.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/6a5edacca249b2e98f2ada7ae7c2fb37.poster.avif?t=1780864084\" width=780 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/6a5edacca249b2e98f2ada7ae7c2fb37.webm?t=1780864084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/6a5edacca249b2e98f2ada7ae7c2fb37.mp4?t=1780864084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloody Shrine is a horde survivor roguelike where every run is shaped by the pacts you make, the rituals you accept, and the Shrine you build on the battlefield. Survive waves of  enemies, forge your build between battles from cards, tokens, and ritual pacts that carry real consequences. Unleash your Spells, fill your Blood Cup and watch your Shrine grow taller and more dangerous with every offering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/3d59eea578ef055ff2a1438e86768454.poster.avif?t=1780864084\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/3d59eea578ef055ff2a1438e86768454.webm?t=1780864084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/3d59eea578ef055ff2a1438e86768454.mp4?t=1780864084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horde survivor roguelike</strong>: Survive waves of enemies and create mayhem while doing so.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/48ab23be239cc17d8b47f31ce920cd4f.poster.avif?t=1780864084\" width=780 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/48ab23be239cc17d8b47f31ce920cd4f.webm?t=1780864084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/48ab23be239cc17d8b47f31ce920cd4f.mp4?t=1780864084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Bloody Shrine</strong>: Collect bones, rubies, and dark relics mid-wave to raise a Shrine that shapes the battlefield around it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/be753e71c702fa33da15a1d20f76ac81.webp?t=1780864084\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/be753e71c702fa33da15a1d20f76ac81.poster.avif?t=1780864084\" class=\"bb_img\" width=384 height=256 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spells and Weapons</strong>: Guns, staffs, melee weapons and auto-firing spells. Each with their own playstyle, and more ways to kill than you'll ever need.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/680717cd2c62ab4fdacdae64df98a4d7.poster.avif?t=1780864084\" width=780 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/680717cd2c62ab4fdacdae64df98a4d7.webm?t=1780864084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/680717cd2c62ab4fdacdae64df98a4d7.mp4?t=1780864084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable weirdos</strong>: Each character embraces a different play style and a different relationship with the Shrine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Pacts with the Shrine</strong>: Bend the rules of every run. Every pact has a trade-off. Every removal has a curse. Nothing comes free.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend wisely or gamble everything</strong>: Crystals, gold, a slot machine, and a shrine that keeps demanding more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/7519859a941a8f356e3237eb6992f719.poster.avif?t=1780864084\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/7519859a941a8f356e3237eb6992f719.webm?t=1780864084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/7519859a941a8f356e3237eb6992f719.mp4?t=1780864084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>The shrine demands blood. You will provide it.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_im