tras/680717cd2c62ab4fdacdae64df98a4d7.mp4?t=1780864084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable weirdos</strong>: Each character embraces a different play style and a different relationship with the Shrine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Pacts with the Shrine</strong>: Bend the rules of every run. Every pact has a trade-off. Every removal has a curse. Nothing comes free.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend wisely or gamble everything</strong>: Crystals, gold, a slot machine, and a shrine that keeps demanding more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/7519859a941a8f356e3237eb6992f719.poster.avif?t=1780864084\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/7519859a941a8f356e3237eb6992f719.webm?t=1780864084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/extras/7519859a941a8f356e3237eb6992f719.mp4?t=1780864084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Bloody Shrine is a twin-stick horde survivor roguelike where you build a growing Shrine on the battlefield, forge dark pacts and shape every run through cards, tokens, and blood.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/header.jpg?t=1780864084", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780864084", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733890/capsul